 style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n              ‍\n             </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n              ‍\n             </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n              ‍\n             </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n              ‍\n             </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n              ‍\n             </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n              ‍\n             </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n              ‍\n             </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n              ‍\n             </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n              ‍\n             </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n              ‍\n             </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n              ‍\n             </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n              ‍\n             </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n              ‍\n             </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n              ‍\n             </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n              ‍\n             </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n              ‍\n             </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n              ‍\n             </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n              ‍\n             </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n              ‍\n             </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"outline: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;\">\n            位于同大产区的Al Ruwad也是蛮有意思的，它是我们第二次选到；第一次买到的Ruwad是非常传统的也门精致日晒处理方式，就好像Aljidan的椰枣风格，第二次选到的炼金术士批次虽然也能感受到椰枣的特征，但会开始出现一些类似Al Mahjar的红酒可可的厌氧发酵感，但它发酵的强度又没有Al Mahjar那么深，同样我觉得低温比高温更好喝～\n            <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n             ‍\n            </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n             ‍\n            </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n             ‍\n            </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n             ‍\n            </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"outline: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"outline: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;\">\n            这四只也都可以做冷萃，而且可以混拼，比如说我喜欢把发酵重的Mahjar和很传统的Aljidan拼一起，让发酵感更柔和一点，也可以再加一点点Sanaf让它多一点复杂性和甜感～wowwowwild\n            <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n             ‍\n            </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n             ‍\n            </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n             ‍\n            </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n             ‍\n            </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n             ‍\n            </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n             ‍\n            </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n             ‍\n            </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n             ‍\n            </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n             ‍\n            </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n             ‍\n            </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n             ‍\n            </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n             ‍\n            </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n             ‍\n            </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n             ‍\n            </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"outline: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;visibility: visible;\">\n<br style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;\"/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7Q0sawsrNuEBTlj8u2G09ax1xgH4tnoj8XGcqcB0xq0qpiamG0OGs3xP4S0y0Off9n6e47StF5lXdg/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1&amp;tp=webp\" style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: var(--articleFontsize);caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: normal;text-align: start;visibility: visible !important;width: 556.1875px !important;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;\">\n<span style='outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n             关于订阅补充说明：\n            </span>\n</section>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-1\" style=\"padding-left: 1.5em;outline: 0px;width: 577.188px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;list-style-type: circle;visibility: visible;\">\n<li style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"outline: 0px;clear: both;min-height: 1em;visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;visibility: visible;\">\n                本期将于2024.7.25号左右陆续发出\n                <strong style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;\">\n                 ，\n                </strong>\n</span>\n<span style='outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;visibility: visible;'>\n                如果需要暂停订阅或者地址有变化，请及时与客服联系暂停或更改；说明：暂停订阅的，重启时订阅剩余期数会顺延，已经错过的豆子不会再安排补发；\n               </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"outline: 0px;clear: both;min-height: 1em;visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;\">\n<span style='outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;visibility: visible;'>\n                订阅链接通道下一次开启时间是双11期间，请大家关注线上店铺的链接～\n               </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;min-height: 1em;visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;\">\n<span style='outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;visibility: visible;'>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;\">\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0em;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;'>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"outline: 0px;clear: both;min-height: 1em;visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;visibility: visible;'>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 24px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;\">\n                     公众号的文章栏目有更多的咖啡信息\n                    </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n                     客服微信：sabh_lt （售前/售后/加群）\n                    </span>\n</section>\n</span>\n</sec